@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title CR-01 年级限定报名（设计稿，尚未实现）

actor 学生 as User
participant "Flask Route" as Route
participant RegistrationService as Service
participant ActivityRepository as Activities
participant StudentRepository as Students
participant RegistrationRepository as Registrations
participant PolicyFactory as Factory
participant "RegistrationPolicy\n运行时为 GradeLimitedDirectPolicy" as Policy
participant EventPublisher as Publisher

User -> Route : POST /register/<activity_id>
Route -> Service : submit(activity_id, student_id)
Service -> Activities : get(activity_id)
Activities --> Service : Activity 或 None
Service -> Students : get(student_id)
Students --> Service : Student（包含 grade）或 None

break 活动或学生不存在
  Service --> Route : BusinessError
  Route --> User : 显示错误，不生成报名
end

Service -> Service : _check_common_rules(activity, student)\n活动未开始；无重复有效报名
Service -> Registrations : has_effective(activity_id, student_id)
Registrations --> Service : 是否已有待审核 / 已通过报名
break 已开始或已有有效报名
  Service --> Route : BusinessError（已开始 / 不可重复报名）
  Route --> User : 显示原因，不生成报名和通知
end

Service -> Factory : create(activity.policy_type)
Factory --> Service : GradeLimitedDirectPolicy
Service -> Policy : submit(activity, student)
break grade 不属于 {2,3}
  Policy --> Service : BusinessError（仅限大二、大三学生）
  Service --> Route : 同一业务异常
  Route --> User : 明确提示，不生成报名和通知
end
Policy --> Service : 已通过

Service -> Policy : requires_quota()
Policy --> Service : True
Service -> Service : _check_quota(activity)
Service -> Registrations : count_approved(activity_id)
Registrations --> Service : 已通过人数
break 已通过人数 >= capacity
  Service --> Route : BusinessError（名额已满）
  Route --> User : 显示原因，不生成报名和通知
end

group 报名持久化事务
  Service -> Registrations : insert(Registration{已通过})
  Registrations -> Registrations : INSERT + COMMIT
  Registrations --> Service : 已保存
end

Service -> Publisher : publish(RegistrationEvent{已通过})
ref over Publisher
  见 09：站内消息 + 模拟邮件
  通知在报名提交之后，失败不回滚报名
end ref
Service --> Route : Registration{已通过}
Route --> User : 重定向，显示报名成功

note over Service,Policy
  执行次序与现有 submit 保持一致：
  公共时间 / 重复校验 → 策略 → 名额 → 保存 → 发布。
  普通直接报名、审核型报名仍使用原策略，不检查年级。
  审核型提交仍为待审核，暂不占名额。
end note
@enduml
